the sentence as pressure despite the absence of any shortcut keyword ("No shortcut word in
that sentence, and it is a deadline all the same") and its next response proposes the
parallelization path with the wall-clock arithmetic and an authorization request.

The ordering constraint that the sibling excerpt used as its reason to serialise is
